00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:07.360
pareidolia is a psychological phenomenon

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:10.320
in which the mind responds to a stimulus

00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:12.520
usually an image or a sound

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:15.200
by perceiving a familiar pattern where none exist

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:17.280
basically you look at one thing

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:19.920
and you're like: wow that looks like this thing

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.920
